验采用了不同频率的入射光"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 1、3 次实验光电管中的金属板材质不同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 第 1 次实验和第 3 次实验逸出的光电子一样多"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 用第 3 次实验逸出的光电子轰击处于 n=2 能级氢原子，氢原子可能向更高能级跃迁"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e843581b05a66297009f695e4cb9da078ccaf31a9c74f482c6b26147e4deb10e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. I.(8分)某同学利用单摆测本地重力加速度,实验装置如图(a)所示,轻质细线上端悬挂在铁架台上,下端挂有强磁小球,其正下方放置智能手机,手机中的磁传感器可以采集磁感应强度实时变化的数据并输出图像,实验步骤如下:\n(1)用毫米刻度尺测出细线长度.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8e47e8863dfbdaf9e12082777a9c8eb57f01405262774c090dc267e25973914c.png","width":318,"height":284,"width_mm":37.38,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图（a）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f544a4ce31d52e02e99418173bbd89d65927b71e7bb88a7c43b65358a9505307.png","width":399,"height":289,"width_mm":46.83,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7251b74c51c9e8ee7dab4b236dca6f5d09890358e7ae3fb3544ff0deab20262d.png","width":355,"height":163,"width_mm":41.58,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图（c）\n第16-I题图\n(2)如图(b)所示,用游标卡尺测量摆球直径,摆球直径d=（填空）cm.\n(3)使单摆做小角度摆动,打开手机的磁传感器软件,此时磁传感器记录的磁感应强度变化周期.\n(4)某次采集到的磁感应强度 B 的大小随时间 t 变化的图像如图(c)所示,从图中可以算出单摆的周期 "},{"type":"math","value":"T="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）(用“ "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ”表示).\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c7d330bffa787012c84b0ca48329948f34686d52269c32ed604b26f79ff80a60.png","width":455,"height":320,"width_mm":58.674,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(5) 改变摆长, 重复实验步骤(3)得到多组数据并画出 "},{"type":"math","value":"L - T^2"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像, 如图(d)所示, 由图像可得当地重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g ="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}^2"},{"type":"text","value":" (保留三位有效数字).\n(6)(多选)以下哪些原因会导致本实验产生误差( )\nA. 空气阻力的影响\nB. 磁传感器的影响\nC. 每次实验单摆振幅不同\nD. 实验过程中更换不同质量的磁性球进行实验\n16-Ⅱ.(6分)为了测量阻值范围在 "},{"type":"math","value":"200\\sim 500\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间的电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻值，实验室提供两组器材，甲组和乙组同学设计了两个实验：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/22ad3584197825b05458b8a6b85e255f61b486ff7b65662426c2dda2c22aeb25.png","width":244,"height":208,"width_mm":28.56,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/05571812b1010e460c57f2ba9ba614e7fcda37a2b9a66a86b23a7c6103e24910.png","width":230,"height":223,"width_mm":26.88,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n第 16—Ⅱ题图\n(1)甲组根据实验目的和提供的如下实验器材设计出图甲实验电路：\nA. 电阻箱(阻值范围 "},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\sim 999.9 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" )\nB. 毫安表(量程 "},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\sim 3 \\, mA"},{"type":"text","value":" , 内阻约 "},{"type":"math","value":"100 \\, \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" )\nC. 直流电源(电动势 E=3 V, 内阻不计)\nD. 三个开关, 足量导线\n甲组操作步骤如下: ①按电路图连好电路, 闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"K_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 记下毫安表的读数.\n②断开 "},{"type":"math","value":"K_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"K_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，调节电阻箱 R 的阻值，使毫安表的读数和①中相同，记下此时电阻箱的示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" .假设该组同学的设计合理，则待测电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）. 经过仔细分析，该设计存在不合理的地方，不合理的地方是 （填空）.\n(2)乙组根据实验目的和提供的如下实验器材设计出图乙实验电路：\nA. 电阻箱(阻值范围 "},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\sim 999.9 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" )\nB. 理想电压表(量程 "},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\sim 2 V"},{"type":"text","value":" )\nC. 直流电源(电动势 E=3 V, 内阻 r=100 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":")\nD. 三个开关, 足量导线\n乙组操作步骤如下: ① 按电路图连好电路, 将 R 调到最大, 然后闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n②将 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 接到 b 端，调节 R，使电压表达到满偏，记下此时电阻箱的示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" .\n③保持 R 的阻值不变, 将 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 接到 a 端, 调整电压表的接线柱, 此时电压表 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{5}{12}"},{"type":"text","value":" 满偏, 则根据乙组同学的设计方案, "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）(具体数值)."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16 - I.(8 分,每空 2 分)\n(2)1.85  (4)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{t_{0}}{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"  (5)9.86  (6)AB\n解析:(2)由图示游标卡尺可知,主尺示数是"},{"type":"math","value":"1.8\\ \\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":",游标尺示数是"},{"type":"math","value":"5\\times0.1\\ \\mathrm{mm}=0.5\\ \\mathrm{mm}=0.05\\ \\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":",游标卡尺示数即小球的直径"},{"type":"math","value":"d=1.8\\ \\mathrm{cm}+0.05\\ \\mathrm{cm}=1.85\\ \\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(4)从图中可以算出单摆振动周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{t_{0}}{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(5)根据"},{"type":"math","value":"T=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{L}{g}}"},{"type":"text","value":",可得"},{"type":"math","value":"L=\\frac{g}{4\\pi^{2}}T^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":",则图线斜率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{g}{4\\pi^{2}}=\\frac{1.24-0}{5.00}=0.25"},{"type":"text","value":",则"},{"type":"math","value":"g=9.86\\ \\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(6)小球振动过程中受空气阻力,空气阻力的影响、磁传感器的影响可能会使本实验产生误差,故选 AB.\n16 - II.(6 分,每空 2 分)\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"  当闭合开关"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{K}_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"后,电路中电流大于毫安表的量程,毫安表将烧毁\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"500\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解析:(1)根据甲组同学的实验电路,该同学采用了等效替代法,故待测电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}=R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲电路中,开关接通后,电流表的读数最小为"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R_{x}}=\\frac{3}{500}\\ \\mathrm{A}=6\\ \\mathrm{mA}"},{"type":"text","value":",已超过了电流表的量程.\n(2)由电路结构可知,"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"与 R 两端的电压之比为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{5}{12}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可知电阻之比为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{5}{12}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}=\\frac{5}{12}R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，将"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"接 b，电压表满偏时，则"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=\\frac{U}{I},I=\\frac{E}{R_{x}+R_{2}+r}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}=500\\ \\Omega"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1861e88903c92dbc92eee08c50a2f260e6f198d04144d6369894f20bfdb6cd86","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (8分)如图所示,由两个不同横截面积的薄壁导热圆筒连接成的气缸水平放置,气缸内一根长度为3L=30 cm的刚性轻质细杆连接的两个活塞间封闭着一定质量的理想气体,活塞A的左边和活塞B的右边是温度恒定为280 K,压强始终保持为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.0\\times10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":" Pa的大气,已知活塞A、B的面积分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{A}=100\\ cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{B}=50\\ cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,活塞与气缸间密闭性良好、不漏气,不计气缸与活塞间的摩擦,当活塞处于如图位置平衡时汽缸内气体的温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}=500\\ K"},{"type":"text","value":" .求:\n(1)此时汽缸内理想气体的压强多大?\n(2)若活塞 B 固定,将气缸内气体温度降至 480 K,气缸内气体的内能（填空）,单位时间内的撞击气缸壁的气体分子数（填空）;(两空均填“增加”“减少”或“不变”)\n(3)若活塞 B 不固定,缓慢降低气缸内气体的温度时活塞 A、B 将向哪边移动,当温度降至 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=400\\ K"},{"type":"text","value":" 时,活塞 A、B 移动的距离多大?\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0e9105da840f17b4bc6d490b883906aa0bdf63fdc660cc1e52cd8771e4c70bfd.png","width":523,"height":269,"width_mm":61.32,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(8分)(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"1.0\\times10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"Pa (2)减少(1分) 减少(1分) (3)向右 10 cm\n解析:(1)设被封闭的理想气体压强为 p,轻细杆对 A 和对 B 的弹力为 F,对活塞 A,有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S_{A}=pS_{A}+F"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n对活塞 B,有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S_{B}=pS_{B}+F"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"p=p_{0}=1.0\\times10^{5}\\ \\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)封闭气体的温度降低，则分子内能减少；体积不变的情况下，气体温度降低，气体平均速率也降低，缸内气体分子在单位时间内碰撞容器壁单位面积上的次数减小.\n(3)当气缸内气体的温度缓慢下降时，活塞处于平衡状态，缸内气体压强不变，气体等压降温，体积减小，所以活塞 A、B 一起向右移动，设活塞 A、B 一起向右移动的距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x'"},{"type":"text","value":"，对理想气体有"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{2}=(2L-x')S_{A}+(L+x')S_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n由盖—吕萨克定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{1}}{T_{1}}=\\frac{V_{2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x'=10cm<2L"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n表明活塞 A 未运动到两筒的连接处，故活塞 A、B 一起向右移动了 10 cm （1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"75a879d5556093dfbbea5d99821bc6f21a15ac4e1675d6489ed8e692ac2d43fe","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (11分)某物理兴趣小组开展赛车轨道设计大赛,设计了如图(a)所示的轨道模型,将一质量为m=1 kg的小车(可看成质点)放置在轨道上,始终受到平行于斜面、大小为8 N的力F的作用.轨道OA可绕轴O在竖直平面内转动,同学们发现改变轨道倾角,小车会产生不同的加速度a,已知小车与轨道间的动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.2"},{"type":"text","value":" ,假定小车与轨道间的最大静摩擦力等于滑动摩擦力.求:(g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" , "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^{\\circ}=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" , "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos37^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" )\n(1) 改变轨道倾角, 发现小车加速度 a 与斜面倾角的关系如图(b)图线所示. 求图线与纵坐标交点 "},{"type":"math","value":"a_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小;\n(2)当倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时, 小车在力 F 的作用下由 O 点从静止开始运动, 2 s 后撤去 F, 求斜面足够长时, 小车沿斜面向上运动的最大距离;\n(3)轨道 A 点有一锁定装置, 若小车运动到 A 点时, 触发锁定装置, 小车停在 A 点, OA = 2 m. 保持 F = 8 N 不变, 小车位于轨道底部, 给小车一初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 1 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" , 求轨道倾角 0 ～ 90° 范围内, 小车在轨道上运动全过程所受到的摩擦力所做的功. (临界角度列函数关系式即可)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e9aa3976a9366761a61a7ebed89d363b3783a8a65793e835893d268f43d99a63.png","width":644,"height":251,"width_mm":75.6,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(11分)(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"6m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)0.84 m\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"0<\\theta\\leq\\theta'"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"math","value":"W_{1}=-4\\cos\\theta;\\theta'<\\theta<90^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"math","value":"W'=-\\frac{2\\cos\\theta}{10\\sin\\theta+2\\cos\\theta-8}"},{"type":"text","value":"(其中"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta'"},{"type":"text","value":"满足"},{"type":"math","value":"40\\sin\\theta'+8\\cos\\theta'=31"},{"type":"text","value":")\n解析:(1)当轨道水平放置时,小车的加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"此时滑动摩擦力"},{"type":"math","value":"f = \\mu N = \\mu mg = 0.2 \\times 1 \\times 10 \\, N = 2 \\, N"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n由牛顿第二定律"},{"type":"math","value":"F - f = ma_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n求得"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{0}=\\frac{F-f}{m}=\\frac{8-2}{1}m/s^{2}=6\\ m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2)设力 F 作用时小车的加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由牛顿第二定律得："},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1}=\\frac{F-mg\\sin37^{\\circ}-\\mu mg\\cos37^{\\circ}}{m}=0.4\\ m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n撤去力 F 后小车的加速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"